<%#
# The action bar of the account list

Shown above the table while at least one account is ticked: how many are selected, «Выбрать все на странице», and one button
per action (apply the plan and modules, extend the trial, block, unblock, link to an organization). A button opens the
confirmation page (`account_bulk_actions#new`, a GET with the numbers of the ticked accounts): it says how many accounts and
what changes, and only a button there runs the action. Without JavaScript the bar is always shown and works the same.

The ticks of the rows are outside this form and belong to it through the `form` attribute (`bulk-accounts-form`), so
the table stays a table. The list the operator is on (its filters and page) goes along as `back`, for the way back.

The script that keeps the count and the bar in step with the ticks is `_bulk_script`, drawn after the table.
%>
<%
  back = request.fullpath
  back = nil unless back.match?(SuperAdmin::AccountBulkActionsController::BACK_FORMAT) && back.length <= SuperAdmin::AccountBulkActionsController::BACK_LENGTH
%>

<%# The wrapper hides the bar: a `hidden` form with a display utility class would stay visible. %>
<div class="mb-3" data-bulk-bar data-testid="bulk-bar">
  <%= form_with url: new_super_admin_account_bulk_action_path, method: :get, local: true, id: 'bulk-accounts-form',
                class: 'flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-n-solid-2 px-4 py-2.5 outline outline-1 -outline-offset-1 outline-n-container',
                html: { 'aria-label': t('super_admin.bulk.bar.label') } do %>
    <%= hidden_field_tag :back, back, id: nil if back %>
    <span class="me-1 text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-n-slate-12" data-bulk-count data-template="<%= t('super_admin.bulk.bar.selected', count: '%{count}') %>" aria-live="polite">
      <%= t('super_admin.bulk.bar.selected', count: 0) %>
    </span>
    <button type="button" class="reset-base cursor-pointer border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-[13px] text-n-brand hover:underline" data-bulk-select-page><%= t('super_admin.bulk.bar.select_all') %></button>
    <span class="mx-1 hidden h-5 w-px bg-n-weak sm:inline-block" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <% SuperAdmin::BulkAccounts::ACTIONS.each do |action| %>
      <%= button_tag t("super_admin.bulk.actions.#{action}"), type: 'submit', name: 'bulk_action', value: action,
                                                              class: 'button button--small button--secondary', data: { testid: "bulk-action-#{action}" } %>
    <% end %>
    <button type="button" class="reset-base ms-auto cursor-pointer border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-[13px] text-n-slate-11 hover:underline" data-bulk-clear><%= t('super_admin.bulk.bar.clear') %></button>
  <% end %>
  <p class="m-0 mt-1.5 text-xs text-n-slate-10"><%= t('super_admin.bulk.bar.limit', count: SuperAdmin::BulkAccounts::LIMIT) %></p>
</div>
